# Build intermediates (release/bin holds the shipped binary)
AccountInventoryDaemon/build/
**/*.obj
**/*.pdb
**/*.ilk
**/*.tlog

# Ghidra scratch project and large raw memory images
analysis/ghidra_proj/
analysis/ghidra_proj_dll/
